The '''Fairylosophy Tower''' is a sub-location of the {{zone|Stillgore Château}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. It is based on an area of the {{zone|Ruins}}.

== Purpose ==
Found throughout the '''Fairylosophy Tower''' are [[Fairylosopher]]s. One of them opens a shop which contains an [[Enigma Souls|Enigma Soul]]. Another [[Fairylosopher]] can be {{Green|yeeted}} off of the Tower to create a [[Fairy Soul]] where it falls.

