== Trivia ==
*The '''Fairylosophy Tower''' contains the only {{Item|Fairy Soul}} in the [[Rift Dimension]].
*Vampires ({{MobSprite|Fledgling;Fledglings}}, {{MobSprite|Splatter;Splatters}}, {{MobSprite|Thrall;Thralls}}) get despawned if they enter the '''Fairylosophy Tower'''.
**Despite being a vampire, the {{MobSprite|Riftstalker Bloodfiend}} does not despawn.

